      "hizbQuarter": 26,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 417,
      "text": "[Remember] when you said to the believers, “Will it not suffice you that your Lord will help you by sending down three thousand angels?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 3,
        "name": "سُورَةُ آلِ عِمۡرَانَ",
        "englishName": "Aal-i-Imraan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Family of Imraan",
        "numberOfAyahs": 200,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 124,
      "juz": 4,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 66,
      "ruku": 54,
      "hizbQuarter": 26,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 418,
      "text": "Yes, if you stay patient and fear Allah, and the enemy should launch a surprise attack on you, your Lord will help you with five thousand marked angels.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 3,
        "name": "سُورَةُ آلِ عِمۡرَانَ",
        "englishName": "Aal-i-Imraan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Family of Imraan",
        "numberOfAyahs": 200,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 125,
      "juz": 4,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 66,
      "ruku": 54,
      "hizbQuarter": 26,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 419,
      "text": "Allah ordained this only as glad tidings for you, and to reassure your hearts thereby. Victory only comes from Allah, the All-Mighty, the All-Wise,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 3,
        "name": "سُورَةُ آلِ عِمۡرَانَ",
        "englishName": "Aal-i-Imraan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Family of Imraan",
        "numberOfAyahs": 200,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 126,
      "juz": 4,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 66,
      "ruku": 54,
      "hizbQuarter": 26,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 420,
      "text": "in order to destroy a section of the disbelievers or disgrace them, so they may turn back utterly disappointed.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 3,
        "name": "سُورَةُ آلِ عِمۡرَانَ",
        "englishName": "Aal-i-Imraan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Family of Imraan",
        "numberOfAyahs": 200,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 127,
      "juz": 4,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 66,
      "ruku": 54,
      "hizbQuarter": 26,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 421,
      "text": "It is not for you [O Prophet] to decide whether He will accept their repentance or punish them, for they are wrongdoers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 3,
        "name": "سُورَةُ آلِ عِمۡرَانَ",
        "englishName": "Aal-i-Imraan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Family of Imraan",
        "numberOfAyahs": 200,
